                                                <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>👤 Order Taken By:</strong> ${order.employee}</p>
                                                <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>📦 Items:</strong> ${order.items}</p>
                                                <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>💰 Total Amount:</strong> ₱${order.total}.00</p>
                                                <p><strong>📊 Status:</strong> ${order.status.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + order.status.slice(1)}</p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    `,
                confirmButtonColor: '#A8A54A',
                confirmButtonText: 'Close',
                width: 600
            });
        }

